@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5205

### CASE 14 - Get all registrations
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations
Accept: application/json

###

### CASE 20 - Find by registration type
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations?registrationType=VIP
Accept: application/json

###

### CASE 21 - Find by registration status
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations?status=Confirmed
Accept: application/json

###

### CASE 22 - Find by participant name
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations?search=juan
Accept: application/json

###

### CASE 23 - Name search ignores case
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations?search=JUAN
Accept: application/json

###

### CASE 24 - Partial name match
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations?search=Ju
Accept: application/json